; A typed lot price names a lot computed from a cost when the prices
; agree to the lesser precision (#524), but only a computed lot of the
; same shape: the same lot date, lot note and price commodity.  The
; typed lots dated 2021/01/02, noted (lot1) or priced in EUR stay apart.

2021/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Broker    23 AAPL @@ $23.60
    Assets:Cash

2021/01/01 Typed, same shape
    Assets:Same      10 AAPL {$1.03} [2021/01/01]
    Equity:Opening

2021/01/01 Typed, other date
    Assets:Date      10 AAPL {$1.03} [2021/01/02]
    Equity:Opening

2021/01/01 Typed, with a note
    Assets:Note      10 AAPL {$1.03} [2021/01/01] (lot1)
    Equity:Opening

2021/01/01 Typed, other price commodity
    Assets:Euro      10 AAPL {1.03 EUR} [2021/01/01]
    Equity:Opening   -10.30 EUR

test bal Assets --lots --flat --no-total
23 AAPL {$1.026087} [2021/01/01]  Assets:Broker
             $-23.60  Assets:Cash
10 AAPL {$1.03} [2021/01/02]  Assets:Date
10 AAPL {1.03 EUR} [2021/01/01]  Assets:Euro
10 AAPL {$1.03} [2021/01/01] (lot1)  Assets:Note
10 AAPL {$1.026087} [2021/01/01]  Assets:Same
end test
